{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>EXPLORE DANGEROUS AREAS, DEFEAT ENEMIES, AND RECOVER THE TRI-CRYSTAL BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/c1d5872c76bb97fb07385154e9939ade.poster.avif?t=1769090860\" width=480 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/c1d5872c76bb97fb07385154e9939ade.webm?t=1769090860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/c1d5872c76bb97fb07385154e9939ade.mp4?t=1769090860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/79c4442ff811f90327cc7c82539e57ac.avif?t=1769090860\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bobble and the Tri-Crystal is a 2D side-scrolling shoot 'em up, inspired by retro handheld consoles. You will face stages where you must reach the end while dodging enemy attacks!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter the ocean and play as Bobble, a detective fish, to stop the escaped prisoners before they get their hands on the Tri-Crystal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/5dc1eb253e68969f4178e9bf2c7d4e7f.avif?t=1769090860\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You'll also face  bosses: prisoners who escaped to unlock their true potential with the Tri-Crystal! Learn their patterns, dodge their attacks, and shoot them down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/aadd14396669fa74b96684722525b89a.poster.avif?t=1769090860\" width=480 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/aadd14396669fa74b96684722525b89a.webm?t=1769090860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/aadd14396669fa74b96684722525b89a.mp4?t=1769090860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeating enemies earns you<i>\u00a0Hero Credits</i>, which can be used to purchase new skills from the shop! Enter a level with two weapons at once, and press a button to switch between them!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/ab5370eba7f0a41acf649c409a9b7806.avif?t=1769090860\" width=478 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u>:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 levels with memorable boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 distinct weapons to make every playthrough unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting story with a big cast of characters and twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics based on old handheld games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for newcomers to Shoot 'Em Ups.</p></li></u