utton to switch between them!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/ab5370eba7f0a41acf649c409a9b7806.avif?t=1769090860\" width=478 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u>:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 levels with memorable boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 distinct weapons to make every playthrough unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting story with a big cast of characters and twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics based on old handheld games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for newcomers to Shoot 'Em Ups.</p></li></ul>","developers":["HenryNova"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/6f39d76b5ddb5918d0141c725990b43059d82c76/header.jpg?t=1769090860","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4077920/1646167866/e6534a3f043988145a6b588272616b2e4adab381/1762174899/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766327260","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4077920/1646167866/e6534a3f043988145a6b588272616b2e4adab381/1762174899/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766327260","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4077920/1646167866/e6534a3f043988145a6b588272616b2e4adab381/1762174899/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766327260","id":257226123,"name":"Bobble and the Tri-Crystal - Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257226123/73224abbf091ed53119cea23783940db842c72d9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766327260"}],"name":"Bobble and the Tri-Crystal","p